WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.800
- I'm all about serving up the best

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.820
of the interwebs that will make you smile.

00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:05.280
This is, "What I'm Liking".

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:07.980
(upbeat music)
(audience applause)

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:10.680
And this one starts, innocently enough.

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:12.740
A nun named, Sister Monica Clare,

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:15.260
posted to her four subscribers, on TikTok,

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:17.930
about a wild Turkey,
terrorizing the property,

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:19.291
outside the convent.

00:00:19.291 --> 00:00:20.124
(swooshing)

00:00:20.124 --> 00:00:21.300
- Okay, so we have this wild turkey,

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:25.123
who's been terrorizing all of
the sisters in the convent.

00:00:25.123 --> 00:00:26.443
(Monica laughs)

00:00:26.443 --> 00:00:28.320
And basically, eating
all our outdoor plants

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:32.010
and scratching up cars and
running off all the birds

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:33.961
and the chipmunks and squirrels.

00:00:33.961 --> 00:00:37.261
(audience cheers)
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:37.261 --> 00:00:38.600
- What is wrong with that turkey?

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:40.740
As you can imagine, Sister Monica Clare,

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:43.180
didn't expect much fanfare from the post,

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:45.460
but in just days, the TikTok racked in

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:48.540
hundreds of thousands of views, why?

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:50.737
Well, she titled her post,

00:00:50.737 --> 00:00:53.312
"Update on the Wild Turkey Situation".

00:00:53.312 --> 00:00:54.830
(audience and Kelly laugh)

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:57.080
Which is awesome because she's a nun.

00:00:57.080 --> 00:00:57.913
(audience laughs)

00:00:57.913 --> 00:00:58.810
Oh, so great.

00:00:58.810 --> 00:01:01.210
Oh, yeah, people clicked
thinking they might see

00:01:01.210 --> 00:01:03.170
a nun, slugging back some whiskey,

00:01:03.170 --> 00:01:06.400
because that's who we are
as a nation, apparently.

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:09.290
But there's more, the
viewers started engaging

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:12.500
with her about the most
unexpected thing, her skin.

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:15.580
We have Sister Monica Clare,
on the line to explain.

00:01:15.580 --> 00:01:17.350
Hey, Sister.
(audience cheers)

00:01:17.350 --> 00:01:19.720
- Hi, Kelly.
(audience cheers)

00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:22.380
Thank you so much for
having me on your show.

00:01:22.380 --> 00:01:24.410
- No, thank you so much
for coming on our show,

00:01:24.410 --> 00:01:26.180
we love you, we are big fans.

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:27.690
So, what did you think,

00:01:27.690 --> 00:01:29.790
when you started getting all the views?

00:01:29.790 --> 00:01:32.270
- I was completely shocked,

00:01:32.270 --> 00:01:35.570
because at the time, I
literally had four followers

00:01:35.570 --> 00:01:37.880
and I was just trying to
make those four people laugh,

00:01:37.880 --> 00:01:41.510
whether this antics of this crazy, turkey,

00:01:41.510 --> 00:01:44.029
who had no boundaries, apparently.

00:01:44.029 --> 00:01:44.862
(audience laughs)

00:01:44.862 --> 00:01:46.620
So, then I started posting
informational videos,

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:49.200
after the turkey videos started to pick up

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:51.290
and all these women started following me,

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:52.570
all these gen-X women,

00:01:52.570 --> 00:01:55.470
with kind of, the same dry
sense of humor that I have.

00:01:55.470 --> 00:01:57.820
And they started messaging me about,

00:01:57.820 --> 00:02:00.090
because I had said that I was 55 years old

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:02.370
and they said, "How
could he be 55 years old?

00:02:02.370 --> 00:02:05.460
Tell us what you do for
your skincare routine".

00:02:05.460 --> 00:02:07.540
And at first, I ignored
it because I'm a nun,

00:02:07.540 --> 00:02:09.440
I'm not supposed to focus on like,

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:12.880
skincare and beauty things.
(Monica and Kelly laugh)

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:15.700
So, basically I just ignored it

00:02:15.700 --> 00:02:17.690
and it just got completely out of hand,

00:02:17.690 --> 00:02:19.577
because every video I
posted people were like,

00:02:19.577 --> 00:02:21.771
"Girl, drop your skincare routine".

00:02:21.771 --> 00:02:25.820
(Kelly and audience laugh)

00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:28.265
- I love where this
started and where it ended.

00:02:28.265 --> 00:02:31.080
(audience cheers)

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:32.410
It started from a wild, turkey,

00:02:32.410 --> 00:02:34.510
to people being curious about a drunk nun

00:02:34.510 --> 00:02:37.100
and then it ended up with skincare.

00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:37.933
It's amazing, actually.

00:02:37.933 --> 00:02:39.550
- Actually, crazy.

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:42.067
And then I got to meet
you, which is wonderful.

00:02:42.067 --> 00:02:42.900
(audience cheers)

00:02:42.900 --> 00:02:44.110
- Well, it's an honor to meet you as well.

00:02:44.110 --> 00:02:46.550
Thank you for joining
us, Sister Monica Clare.

00:02:46.550 --> 00:02:49.069
I'm liking your posts right now.

00:02:49.069 --> 00:02:49.902
(bell dings)

00:02:49.902 --> 00:02:50.735
- [Monica] Thank you.

00:02:50.735 --> 00:02:51.568
- Well, that's not all,

00:02:51.568 --> 00:02:53.670
our season long partner, Pilot Pen G2,

00:02:53.670 --> 00:02:55.220
the go-to pen of the Kelly Clarkson show,

00:02:55.220 --> 00:02:58.450
thinks that your TikToks
are fantastic, as we do.

00:02:58.450 --> 00:03:00.320
So, in recognition,
they'll be using their,

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:03.888
G2 gelling pen to write you a
check for a thousand dollars.

00:03:03.888 --> 00:03:06.459
(audience cheers)

00:03:06.459 --> 00:03:08.779
- [Monica] That's so sweet, thank you.

00:03:08.779 --> 00:03:09.862
- Absolutely.

